<section class="reic-module" data-reic-module="134"><header><span class="reic-kicker">TAMPILAN</span><h2>Pengaturan Tampilan</h2></header><p>Atur skala dan orientasi area kerja tanpa mengubah ukuran layar perangkat.</p><form data-reic-form><label for="display-scale">Skala antarmuka</label><input id="display-scale" name="scale" type="range" min="80" max="140" value="100"><output data-reic-value>100%</output><label for="display-orientation">Orientasi area kerja</label><select id="display-orientation" name="orientation"><option value="auto">Otomatis</option><option value="portrait">Potret</option><option value="landscape">Lanskap</option></select><button type="submit">TERAPKAN</button></form><output class="reic-status" aria-live="polite">Pengaturan belum diterapkan.</output></section>
